[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15121.269, "timestamp": "04:12:01", "text": "边。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15123.349, "timestamp": "04:12:03", "text": "我的意思是，接下来还有更多内容。我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15125.59, "timestamp": "04:12:05", "text": "我想说，我很高兴来到这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15127.99, "timestamp": "04:12:07", "text": "就像和乔斯合作一样。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15130.07, "timestamp": "04:12:10", "text": "邀请。我只希望你能拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15133.75, "timestamp": "04:12:13", "text": "和你的未来共度美好时光。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15137.11, "timestamp": "04:12:17", "text": "是的，我也很感激和高兴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15139.83, "timestamp": "04:12:19", "text": "我们就是这样进行合作的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15141.83, "timestamp": "04:12:21", "text": "好久没像以前那样进行个人合作了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15146.229, "timestamp": "04:12:26", "text": "就像我们所有人见面和合作那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15149.189, "timestamp": "04:12:29", "text": "之前是小组，对吧？因为这是我们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15151.83, "timestamp": "04:12:31", "text": "首次个人合作。是的，第一次独奏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15154.79, "timestamp": "04:12:34", "text": "合作。我很高兴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15157.75, "timestamp": "04:12:37", "text": "是的，我很高兴来到这里。嗯。感谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15159.63, "timestamp": "04:12:39", "text": "你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15164.309, "timestamp": "04:12:44", "text": "那么，我们就到此为止吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15167.15, "timestamp": "04:12:47", "text": "是的。再见。你好。再见。谢谢你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15169.91, "timestamp": "04:12:49", "text": "今天。祝你今晚过得愉快！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15173.79, "timestamp": "04:12:53", "text": "祝你考试顺利！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15176.63, "timestamp": "04:12:56", "text": "这意味着我还需要适应一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15178.309, "timestamp": "04:12:58", "text": "姓名。"}]